    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="32.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 32.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is þonne án ærest æt ðam ætfengan þe swicigende manswican lufedan be westan, þe mænigne man geswænctan ⁊ on unriht gedrehtan. [D only]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Firstly, with regard to the process of attaching property, to which crafty rogues in the west have been much addicted and by which many people have been harassed and unjustly oppressed.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[32.1–32.5 are found only in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
